 "What procedure must the central authority follow before drafting or amending the national EE guidelines?",
 ["Consult the relevant agencies and post the draft on its website for thirty days to solicit public comments","Consult the relevant agencies and post the draft on its website for fourteen days to solicit public comments","Obtain Executive Yuan approval and post the draft on its website for sixty days to solicit public comments","Hold a public hearing and post the draft on municipal and county authority websites for thirty days for comments"],
